1
00:00:00,377 --> 00:00:04,927
(Sheldon:)Mm. Great news, Leonard.
I've solved my Penny gift dilemma.

2
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:06,760
(Leonard:)Yippee.

3
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:10,217
(Sheldon:)You see, the danger was that
I might under-or over-reciprocate...

4
00:00:10,387 --> 00:00:12,307
(Sheldon:)...but I have devised a foolproof plan.

5
00:00:12,889 --> 00:00:18,189
(Sheldon:)I will open her gift to me first and then
excuse myself, feigning digestive distress.

6
00:00:18,353 --> 00:00:21,443
Then I'll look up the price
of her gift online...

7
00:00:21,606 --> 00:00:25,196
...choose the basket closest to that value,
give it to her...

8
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,490
...and then I'll return the others
for a full refund.

9
00:00:29,781 --> 00:00:31,451
(Leonard:)Brilliant.

10
00:00:31,616 --> 00:00:33,576
(Sheldon:)It is, isn't it?

11
00:00:34,119 --> 00:00:35,999
(Sheldon:)Is it okay if I hide them in your room?

12
00:00:36,162 --> 00:00:39,162
(Sheldon:)The smell makes me nauseated.

13
00:00:39,791 --> 00:00:45,021
- Do whatever you want.
- Thank you. That's very gracious.

